{"title":"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The geometric series <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/8/8787cbcb8f1168d424245c916cae5453aeb6e355.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+ar+ar^2\\ldots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"121\" height=\"16\" /> has a sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and the terms involving odd powers of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> have a sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/7/ee7b137b20ca10fdd93861cfa276a285f2385696.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/0/8f0809af0d16a7cab0580c3f0315eaf3548d5f06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{4}{3}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{12}{7}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{3}{2}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{7}{3}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{5}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"376\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of an infinite geometric series is given by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/2/d92b8c5d55f66f20ed3f225d99a712796b2efced.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{1-r}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"42\" height=\"33\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is the first term and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is the common ratio.\n</p><p>In this series, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/f/f3fa945f28e072b2dc1ff032e8f91419f658714f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{1-r} = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"77\" height=\"33\" />\n</p><p>The series with odd powers of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is given as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/e/d7e66addf3f0977ed2667bd9ec0f8919e3857dfd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[ar + ar^3 + ar^5 ...\\]\" width=\"127\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Its sum can be given by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/4/e0470959a853394e455bca86cb99cc04b36ed7b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{ar}{1-r^2} = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"84\" height=\"33\" />\n</p><p>Doing a little algebra\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/4/0d4cc8f8d29fe1e84828d5636af25dce6326e957.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ar = 3(1-r)(1+r)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"158\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/4/b7406741a3acb4f4b58653694e2c7c4fb074a342.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ar = 3\\left(\\frac{a}{7}\\right)(1+r)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"145\" height=\"33\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/8/428fe059654dcbc0b9c01f344643cbe41ae14b5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{7}{3}r = 1 + r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"85\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/6/b06162ef4a193b84be6dad1629621a9f16ca47ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = \\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"44\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/a/6ea61b4285f37ae0e6e42ecf2b70762fd4a31c4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 7(1-r) = \\frac{7}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"133\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/8/6e86f3d69b6ac1b12f7a60a94618754e8505d637.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + r =\\boxed{ \\frac{5}{2}} \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(E)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"142\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The given series can be decomposed as follows: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/2/552b67239ee7bc3d1b7f6ff1458304254abdeab8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a + ar + ar^2 + \\ldots) = (a + ar^2 + ar^4 + \\ldots) + (ar + ar^3 + ar^5 + \\ldots)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"535\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Clearly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/d/e6daa5a43026b7139ab382de22bbd8c8f77aa66d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a + ar^2 + ar^4 + \\ldots) = (ar + ar^3 + ar^5 + \\ldots)/r = 3/r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"427\" height=\"19\" />. We obtain that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/6/126932857619b3dd44c47623a9fd32c810a6b6cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7 = 3/r + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"91\" height=\"18\" />, hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/6/b06162ef4a193b84be6dad1629621a9f16ca47ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = \\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"44\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Then from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37e06f6ec429efeb8a9266cc86eee3fa4f0473d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7 = (a + ar + ar^2 + \\ldots) = \\frac{a}{1-r}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"256\" height=\"33\" /> we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/e/daeff2538e8f838e7d592be5f0e2bc3559e5a1db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=\\frac{7}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"45\" height=\"37\" />, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/2/3921c9705652058f8e6876e337580c0f57a3b1f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + r = \\boxed{\\frac{5}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"89\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B\">2007 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017213247\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 227/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2